caches (emulator_runs.csv, emulator_multilocus.csv, emulator_spectrum.csv, emulator_map.csv) and
computed the remaining 111 map rows; the primary and secondary sections are identical to the
first run's (checked by diff). The wall times above are the second run's. First run: primary
